sequenceDiagram
  actor Human as Authorized reviewer
  participant API as Review API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL owner
  Human->>API: Read candidates and decision revision 2
  API->>DB: Tenant-scoped read
  DB-->>API: Alternatives and immutable evidence references
  API-->>Human: Candidates, evidence links and revision 2
  Note over Human,DB: Another accepted adjudication advances revision to 3
  Human->>API: Publish chosen candidate, expected revision 2
  API->>DB: Transaction: authorize and compare revision
  alt Revision differs
    DB-->>API: Rollback - stale review
    API-->>Human: Conflict - reload alternatives and decide
  else Revision matches
    DB->>DB: Append decision and update publication atomically
    DB-->>API: Commit
    API-->>Human: Published decision identity
  end
